  "description": {
   "en": "Spinel Garland is a rough and turbulent man who loves \"cute things,\" despite his tough face and appearance. He languished in prison for some reason, but upon his release, he decides to live a new life dedicated to his passion. With a fluffy beast he met in town and a legendary girl from the \"Tenjin Tribe,\" he then sets up a \"Fluffy Café\" to start his new life... But big difficulties keep following him one after another?!"
